# [MATCH 2026-09-02] live mutable state — owned by the RUNNING bot, never by
# git. Tracking these made the box unable to sit on origin/main (a pull
# would overwrite live memory), which kept the Git<->Production light
# honest-red forever. The repo keeps only the static backup snapshot.
state.json
signal_memory.json
governance/discipline_state.json
